    "status": "present",
    "value": "Express target using only the integer x and binary arithmetic operators without parentheses, minimizing the number of operators under normal precedence. The approach is: base-x digit DP keeps positive and carried-negative expression costs; unit x/x costs2. Its target cost is O(log_x target) time/O(1) space. Treat the invariant underlying that approach as the reason each local update preserves the required result. Check it against an independent bounded reference before relying on large-domain constructions."
  },
